  "findings": [
    "Java Participant#getDisplay filters the shared SequenceDiagram.hiddenPortions set and then addFirst/add preserves CommandParticipant declaration-time stereotypePositionTop. DrawableSetInitializer#createParticipant supplies this Display to heads and tails. All 16 original cited Java source files and four checker-added source files are byte-exact at the pinned revision.",
